        <mxCell id="kWLGCwOxszkKAL75RuBp-10" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Each device stores its own &quot;last synced&quot; timestamp , the newest changed_at it has pulled so far. On refresh/app open/reconnect, the device sends that timestamp to the server, asking for every row in the changes table (for its user_id) with a changed_at after it. If there are any, we pull and apply them locally, then update our bookmark to the newest changed_at we just received. No shared/global timestamp needed , each device tracks this independently" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="167.5" width="250" x="1200" y="-268.38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kWLGCwOxszkKAL75RuBp-12" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="same path for device B" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="120" x="1745" y="-175.88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kWLGCwOxszkKAL75RuBp-14" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="For the changes, we&#39;re gonna define a table of changes, having user_id (firebase), what table changed, what row, what the new data is, and the time it was changed." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="175" x="930" y="-290" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kWLGCwOxszkKAL75RuBp-16" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="we will build a manual power sync between device and the server , checking for connectivity with a riverpod provider , everytime connectivity change for there is internet , we check what network tasks should implement" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="200" x="1130" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kWLGCwOxszkKAL75RuBp-19" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Note for clarification: local db side will always work the same, but whenever internet is available and it&#39;s time to sync, before doing this we send our last synced timestamp, get back any changes since then, apply them locally, then push our own pending local changes to the server." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="220" x="840" y="-45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
